# 1. YOUR ROLE & DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, Firebase Developer, Database Engineer, and Application Security Specialist.

Your task is to design and develop a professional application named **NEXUS OS**.

NEXUS OS is not a simple To-Do application. It is a centralized Personal Command Center that combines:

- Personal Productivity Management
- Task & Project Management
- Team Responsibility Management
- Routine & Calendar Management
- Performance Tracking
- Personal Development
- Financial Management

The application must have a unified architecture where all modules share the same central database.

**Core Principle: Enter data once, use it everywhere.**

Do not build disconnected modules. Every module must communicate with the central database and maintain consistent relationships.

The final application should be scalable, maintainable, secure, and suitable for real-world daily use.

